      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "琵魯製作的超Z隊隊旗。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "74359B6F88FD4F5C76848D85005A968A968A65D730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在旅館前面打寶可夢對戰，\n只會讓客人覺得這間旅館很古怪吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572865C59928524D976262535BF653EF59225C0D6230FF0C000A53EA67038B935BA24EBA89BA5F979019959365C599285F8853E4602A54273002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在寶可夢對戰敞開自己的心房吧。\n所謂的了解彼此就是這麼一回事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57285BF653EF59225C0D6230655E958B81EA5DF176845FC3623F54273002000A62408B0276844E8689E35F7C6B645C31662F90199EBC4E0056DE4E8B3002001000020114000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為有寶可夢在我身邊，\n我才變得比較容易和別人搭話……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n也就是說是寶可夢\n給了我認識世界的契機。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA67095BF653EF5922572862118EAB908AFF0C000A6211624D8B8A5F976BD48F035BB96613548C52254EBA642D8A712026202600100001BE01000A4E5F5C31662F8AAA662F5BF653EF5922000A7D664E8662118A8D8B584E16754C768459516A5F3002001000020114000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只是單純住在同一個城市\n是無法縮短寶可夢與人之間的距離的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA662F55AE7D144F4F5728540C4E00500B57CE5E02000A662F71216CD57E2E77ED5BF653EF592282074EBA4E4B959376848DDD96E276843002001000020114000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷處處有驚喜。\n而驚喜正是獲得新知的開端喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F78655865567099A5A559C3002000A800C9A5A559C6B63662F73725F9765B077E57684958B7AEF55943002001000020114000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "ZA登峰戰\n如果不活用寶可夢的力量就無法獲勝。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n至於要怎麼活用寶可夢的力量呢？\n那就是要認識寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A0041767B5CF06230000A5982679C4E0D6D3B75285BF653EF59227684529B91CF5C3171216CD5737252DD300200100001BE01000A81F365BC8981600E9EBC6D3B75285BF653EF59227684529B91CF5462FF1F000A90A35C31662F89818A8D8B585BF653EF59223002001000020114000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果是瑪琪艾兒，\n她應該會為<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳指引明路的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C662F746A742A827E5152FF0C000A597961C98A72670370BA00100003110000FF01014F6059B363075F15660E8DEF76843002001000020114000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳說ZA登峰戰<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+000D>Text_infinity嗎？\n我會一邊留意睡眠不足，一邊享受喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B38AAA005A0041767B5CF0623000100002BD0A000D0054006500780074005F0069006E00660069006E00690074007955CEFF1F000A621167034E00908A7559610F776177204E0D8DB3FF0C4E00908A4EAB53D755943002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "若是像塔的失控這樣的大事件，\n會出現連鎖反應而有其他事情發生。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "82E5662F50CF58547684593163A790196A23768459274E8B4EF6FF0C000A670351FA73FE9023939653CD61C9800C670951764ED64E8B60C5767C751F3002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "闊星的人也真是辛苦呢。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n他們一定有被<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>\n硬逼著吃可頌咖哩。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "95CA661F76844EBA4E5F771F662F8F9B82E65462300200100001BE01000A4ED650114E005B9A670988AB00100002018B0001000A786C903C8457540353EF980C549654E93002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>總裁，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā妳你又在偷懶了，這樣可以嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002018B00017E3D88C1FF0C000A00100003110000FF010159B34F6053C85728507761F64E86FF0C90196A2353EF4EE555CEFF1F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "ZA登峰戰<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+000D>Text_infinity呀。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我也是個閱歷豐富的人，\n要在這個大賽中脫穎而出應該也不是夢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A0041767B5CF0623000100002BD0A000D0054006500780074005F0069006E00660069006E0069007400795440300200100001BE01000A62114E5F662F500B95B16B778C505BCC76844EBAFF0C000A898157289019500B59278CFD4E2D812B7A4E800C51FA61C98A724E5F4E0D662F5922FF01001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那個故作神秘的大叔是何方神聖？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3500B65454F5C795E79D87684592753D4662F4F5565B9795E8056FF1F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>即使不在旅館，\n也還是超Z隊的隊長嘛！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002018B000153734F7F4E0D572865C59928FF0C000A4E5F9084662F8D85005A968A7684968A9577561BFF01001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "琵魯你真是的，\n看來<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>在這裡讓你很開心呢～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "74359B6F4F60771F662F7684FF0C000A770B4F8600100002018B00015728901988E18B934F605F88958B5FC35462FF5E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟ZA登峰戰<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+000D>Text_infinity中備受矚目的\n就是我和<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>的再戰啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF005A0041767B5CF0623000100002BD0A000D0054006500780074005F0069006E00660069006E0069007400794E2D509953D777DA76EE7684000A5C31662F6211548C00100002010000007684518D6230554AFF0100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟在參加ZA登峰戰<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+000D>Text_infinity時的我\n可是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的勁敵嘛！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF572853C352A0005A0041767B5CF0623000100002BD0A000D0054006500780074005F0069006E00660069006E006900740079664276846211000A53EF662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B3768452C16575561BFF0100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然我努力在裝得像個總裁……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但如果不是大家在我身邊的話，\n我也沒辦法有這樣的未來啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D67136621152AA529B572888DD5F9750CF500B7E3D88C12026202600100001BE01000A4F465982679C4E0D662F59275BB6572862118EAB908A76848A71FF0C000A62114E5F6C928FA66CD5670990196A237684672A4F86554A300200100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然我努力在裝得像個總裁……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但如果不是大家在我身邊的話，\n我也沒辦法迎接這樣的未來吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D67136621152AA529B572888DD5F9750CF500B7E3D88C12026202600100001BE01000A4F465982679C4E0D662F59275BB6572862118EAB908A76848A71FF0C000A62114E5F6C928FA66CD58FCE63A590196A237684672A4F865427300200100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "琵魯製作的\n安馨兒的甜甜圈店的招牌。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "74359B6F88FD4F5C7684000A5B8999A851527684751C751C57085E97768462DB724C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "擺放著AZ收集的書籍。\n有時候安馨兒好像也會翻閱。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
